# Data

Large raw and processed datasets are not stored directly in this
GitHub repository.

The thesis uses the following core data sources:

## 1. OpenStreetMap

Used to construct the Greater London road network.

The network is obtained programmatically using OSMnx.

Data source:
https://www.openstreetmap.org/

OSMnx:
https://osmnx.readthedocs.io/

## 2. STATS19 Road Safety Data

Police-reported personal-injury road collision data produced by the
UK Department for Transport.

STATS19 will be used to construct historical collision information
and future road-segment collision outcomes.

## 3. Department for Transport Road Traffic Statistics

Traffic count and Annual Average Daily Flow (AADF) information will
be used to represent traffic exposure.

Data source:
https://roadtraffic.dft.gov.uk/

## Local Data Structure

data/
├── raw/
│   ├── osm/
│   ├── stats19/
│   └── dft/
